Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:20.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. I feel horrible, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:20.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道  我很难过  行吗
