Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.99,0:02:45.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. See you, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.99,0:02:45.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  再见各位
