Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.13,0:02:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小心啊孩子们  他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I gotta go sell some Christmas trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得去卖圣诞树了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:02:56.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have fun. Oh, wait! No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:02:56.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卖得开心点  等等  不要去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:59.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I forgot. I am totally against that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:59.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我忘了  我现在完全反对这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:02.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Me having a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:02.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  反对我有工作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I am against innocent trees 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我反对无辜的树木 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.82,0:03:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}being cut down in their prime...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.82,0:03:09.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在其青春正盛的时候被砍下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:12.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and their corpses grotesquely dressed...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:12.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而尸体还被装饰得怪模怪样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:14.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}in, like, tinsel and twinkly lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:14.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}挂上一堆金箔和闪灯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.31,0:03:17.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you sleep at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.31,0:03:17.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你晚上睡得好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:20.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm pretty tired from lugging the trees around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:20.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我拖着树  走来走去累得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:24.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Phoebe, listen, you got this all wrong. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:24.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  你完全搞错了  
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.65,0:03:27.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Those trees were born to be Christmas trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.65,0:03:27.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那些树生来就是要当圣诞树的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:31.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're fulfilling their life purpose by making people happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:31.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通过为人们带来欢乐来实现生命的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:32.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:32.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:35.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:35.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:39.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, and the trees are happy too...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:39.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  这些树也很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:42.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because for most of them, it's their only...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:42.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为对大多数的树来说  这是它们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:43.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}chance to see New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:43.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}见识纽约的唯一机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.55,0:03:49.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After you deliver the drinks, you take the empty tray
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.55,0:03:49.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}送完饮料之后  把空盘子...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:54.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gunther, please. I have worked here for two and a half years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:54.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甘瑟  拜托  我在这里做了两年半
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.37,0:03:57.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know the empty trays go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.37,0:03:57.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道空盘子要放在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:03:59.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if you put them here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:03:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放在这里怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.91,0:04:04.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, that's actually a really good idea. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.91,0:04:04.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这倒是个好主意  
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.17,0:04:05.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because that way they'll be closer to the mugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.17,0:04:05.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}离马克杯比较近
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? You should have the other waitresses do that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该要其他服务生也照办
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They already do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们本来就是这么放的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:14.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why they call it the tray spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:14.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以她们管这里叫盘子区
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.89,0:04:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Jeez, I always heard them talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.89,0:04:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天哪  我总听她们说这个  
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:19.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I sort of just thought it was, like, a club they went to. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:19.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还以为是她们参加的俱乐部  天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:24.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm sorry. - It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:24.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对不起  -没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甜心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.89,0:04:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So this must be kind of neat for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.89,0:04:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定很高兴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:36.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your dad tells me you get a couple days off school...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:36.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你爸爸说你可以不用上学
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:40.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and you don't have to sell those cookies anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:40.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不必再去卖饼干了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I kind of wanted to sell the cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很想去卖饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:46.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The girl who sells the most wins a trip to Space Camp...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:46.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卖最多饼干的人可以参加太空营
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:49.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and gets to sit in a real space shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:49.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坐上真正的太空飞船
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:54.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You really like all this space stuff, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:54.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很喜欢太空的东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:55.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, my dad says 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:55.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的  我爸爸说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:04:58.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}if I'd spend as much time helping him clean apartments...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:04:58.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我帮他清洁公寓的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.47,0:05:00.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}as I do daydreaming about outer space...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.47,0:05:00.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和我做太空白日梦的时间一样多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:03.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}he'd be able to afford a trip to the Taj Mahal.
