Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:01.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could you do me one favor? If it's not too much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:01.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮我一个忙好吗  希望不会麻烦你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, Sarah. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的  莎拉  你尽管说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could you pull the curtains open for me?
