Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:41.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}they're just fulfilling their Christmas
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:41.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它们只是在实现他们的圣诞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.74,0:07:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Destiny. Yes. - Sure.
