Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.61,0:08:56.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll tell you what. I'll put you down for 8 boxes. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.61,0:08:56.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样吧  我算你八盒  
