Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:24.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, you know, I'm sure that's not gonna happen this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:24.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是  我确定这次一定不会这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:27.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't I just put you down for 3 of Mint Treasures 
